    "body": "It seems [`<option>.selected` is different](https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?%3Cselect%20id%3Dselect%3E%0A%20%20%3Coption%20id%3Done%3Eone%3C%2Foption%3E%0A%20%20%3Coption%20id%3Dtwo%3Etwo%3C%2Foption%3E%0A%3C%2Fselect%3E%0A%3Cscript%3E%0Aone%20%3D%20document.getElementById(%27one%27)%3B%0Atwo%20%3D%20document.getElementById(%27two%27)%3B%0Aselect.innerHTML%20%3D%20%27%27%3B%0Aw(one.selected)%3B%0Aw(two.selected)%3B%0Aselect.appendChild(one)%3B%0Aselect.appendChild(two)%3B%0Aw(select.value)%3B%0A%3C%2Fscript%3E) as well. (Or does your Chromium change undo that as well?)",
